                        <div>
                           <div class="divider bg-white"></div>
                           <p class="text-white">At SVCC, we make every decision with your goals in mind. Here you will get an exceptional
                              education at an affordable cost that will prepare you for life after graduation.</p><a href="/students/future/index.html" target="_self" class="btn btn-link">Learn More</a></div>
