                        <div class="col-12 col-md-8">
                           <h2>Explore Majors &amp; Programs</h2>
                           <p>No matter what you study at SVCC, you'll learn more about yourself. That's because
                              SVCC professors don't just teach in classrooms, they talk to you about establishing
                              and realizing goals, and they help make sure you are on the right academic path.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-12 col-md-4 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-end"><a href="/academics/programs/index.html" target="_self" class="btn btn-default btn-xl">Explore All Programs <span class="fa fa-arrow-right"></span></a></div>
                     </div>
                  </div>
