         <p>&nbsp;</p>
         
         <div class="bg-black index-video">
            <div class="index-video-bg" style="background-image: url('/_resources/images/assets/svcc_spring.jpg');">
               <div class="video-caption">
                  
                  <h1>Experience SVCC</h1>
                  
                  <p>It starts with a beautiful campus, a place rich in history that will inspire your
                     future. At SVCC, professors focus on teaching and students support one another. Welcome
                     Home.</p>
                  
                  <p><a class="btn btn-link" href="/students/future/visit-campus/index.html">Schedule and Visit</a></p>
